ends ctle

VDD (vdd 0) vsource dc=1.8
VB (vb 0) vsource dc=0.65
VIP (inp 0) vsource dc=1.0 mag=0.5
VIN (inn 0) vsource dc=1.0 mag=0.5 phase=180
X1 (inp inn outp outn vdd 0 vb) ctle
CLD (outp outn) capacitor c=50f
